{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Liven up your town with the SamabakeScramble Additional Personalities Pack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add all-new potential for character customization with this additional personality pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes 8 brand-new and unique character personalities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchasing the SamabakeScramble Additional Personalities Pack will unlock the following personality types for use in game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Female Personalities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbIntrovert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbHeiress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbSlacker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbGeek</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbNarcissist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbDynamo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Male Personalities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbInnocent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbVagabond</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(*Please note that male characters are not voiced.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These fascinating new personalities will add new depth to your charming seaside community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is entirely a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Any names, organizations, locations, or events appearing in this game are fictitious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Any resemblance to real names, organizations, locations, events, etc. is purely coincidental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, all characters that appear in this game are adults who comply with the applicable laws and regulations of the region in which this game is played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The content of this game is a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attempts to recreate in-game actions or events in real life may be punishable by law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please refrain from imitating or playing out scenes depicted in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578770?t=1745283731","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578770/03d63a72e855b039da9a5fd7931fdd3b8c2f68fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745283731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578770/76ff57b749527ecade005430fec55c3132cd2669/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745283731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578770/76ff57b749527ecade005430fec55c3132cd2669/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745283731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","